* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/ˈɡɑː.nə/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈɡɑːɹ.nɚ/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-uk-garner.ogg|Audio (UK)|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-garner.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}
